    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《仝心就仝面》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蕭文興</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgNPxiYSeVod-bx-qvhYpe_IRVAOuqa-D4W6tnMvPztIRh_4fR0BOCSSHONPPBoIsASe5uPPYVQnvj7I4JbKkYY3VDbPqNecYjYmOf4qYCMG1-Z2LDkdhl4TmnJ4whw5FYCY1HODLjyYiU45Gj-OxZTj8iKmNcWPv-N24n2IFZLI_vKtSrc5I_9sucb5Cgm\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgNPxiYSeVod-bx-qvhYpe_IRVAOuqa-D4W6tnMvPztIRh_4fR0BOCSSHONPPBoIsASe5uPPYVQnvj7I4JbKkYY3VDbPqNecYjYmOf4qYCMG1-Z2LDkdhl4TmnJ4whw5FYCY1HODLjyYiU45Gj-OxZTj8iKmNcWPv-N24n2IFZLI_vKtSrc5I_9sucb5Cgm=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhM0wYJ3L8lpD2_FlRIHhaOIjU41mxSI264eilu43MWHXlPaq8GP7WCIMW9sh_Ok07nCNXjGbeUZ-BZv4CXpoVxguwJfAM3K9sMRfMTXHV052T37de0tf8pbImj__R4nwVZPmwzh4WyX4gf73VLXFm5wdAhmC-PlXqEEkfDhASaeJHYE6IdHmEf763_uemJ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhM0wYJ3L8lpD2_FlRIHhaOIjU41mxSI264eilu43MWHXlPaq8GP7WCIMW9sh_Ok07nCNXjGbeUZ-BZv4CXpoVxguwJfAM3K9sMRfMTXHV052T37de0tf8pbImj__R4nwVZPmwzh4WyX4gf73VLXFm5wdAhmC-PlXqEEkfDhASaeJHYE6IdHmEf763_uemJ=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">真濟人hònn玄leh問：「Lín to就已經有兩个查埔囡仔--ah，為啥mi̍h koh beh去pun一个查某囝？萬不二伊若知影家己ê身世，kám ē就離開--lín？」差不多18年前，阮透過兒童福利聯盟pun著一个查某囝了後，tsit个問題直直hōo人問起。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">論真講，其實tsiânn單純，阮翁某想beh koh愛一个查某囝，驚又koh生著查埔--ê，規氣用pun--ê khah妥當。而且ē-sái hōo一个需要家庭ê囡仔有一个閃風ê港口，mā是一件好代誌。有後生koh有查某囝ē ke tsiok圓滿。阮爸母知影了後mā真認同。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">領養ê過程無hiah-nī簡單，tio̍h-ài經過面試、上課、考核、鬥對、試養、法院判決等等ê法律過程，足足過兩年hiah久，tsiah提著一張薄薄ê法院證明，比家己有身生--出-來--ê koh-khah oh，實在有夠歡喜。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">查某囝tshím來ê時tsiah一歲外，伊生做古錐巧神，看著人lóng是笑bi-bi。因為厝內雄雄ke一个囡仔，厝邊看阮某ê眼神感覺奇怪奇怪。有一个oo-bá-sáng細聲問講：「是偷生--honnh？哪ē無看著你大腹肚？」後--來伊知影是阮pun--ê，tsiah無繼續leh tshi-bú-tshi̍h-tshū。有一工beh暗仔tshuā查某囝去社區一樓散步，厝邊阿婆問講：「Hit个是lín查某孫--ooh？」我講：「無--lah，是阮查某囝--lah。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿婆繼續講：「看bē出--leh，kánn-ná是lín查某孫--neh！」我笑講：「伊減我45歲，做阿公mā ē得過--lah！」想bē到查某囝來，我隨變做少年阿公。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有人煩惱血緣ê問題講，萬一若是有一工冤家ê時，伊氣phut-phut講：「我m̄是lín親生--ê，lín mài tshap--我」，beh按怎？Kám ē頭越--leh就走？電視劇真濟lóng án-ne搬--neh！Tsit方面阮自伊細漢就不時kā伊講：「你m̄是阮親生--ê，m̄-koh上帝tsiok疼--你，hōo你比一般人koh ke一對爸母來惜--你。」「無m̄-tio̍h，你m̄是uì阿母ê腹肚生--出-來--ê，m̄-koh的確是阮心肝頭生--出-來--ê--őo！」——tsit句話，是我想好tsiok久ê答案。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">前一站仔，阮翁某結婚30年tī教會慶祝，規家伙做伙hip相做記念ê時，tsiok濟人leh問講：「伊kám m̄是lín pun--來--ê？哪ē kah媽媽生做hiah-nī成？」阮某應講：「Suah m̄知影 “仝心就ē仝面”--lah！Hah hah！」舊年阮查某囝接受訪問ê時講：「我知影我是阿爸阿母pun--來--ê。進前ê性命親像一tsuā冒險ê旅途，khah早是in照顧--我，後擺in食老就換我來照顧--in。」聽--著阮翁某目箍tâm-tâm！見若心內有惜疼，親情感情就bē散！領養tsit件代誌實在是值得逐家來tshui-sak。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr